    "field": "Seasonal stratospheric prediction",
    "problem": "This paper addresses the challenge of seasonal stratospheric prediction by investigating how well forecast systems represent the polar vortex, its coupling with lower-stratosphere wave activity, and the influence of predictability sources like El Ni\u00f1o\u2013Southern Oscillation and the Quasi-Biennial Oscillation.",
    "method": "This paper investigates the predictability of the Northern Hemisphere winter stratosphere by analyzing the connection between the stratospheric polar vortex and lower-stratosphere wave activity in five seasonal forecast systems using an adapted analytical relation and various forecast verification metrics.",
    "task": "The task is to investigate the predictability of the Northern Hemisphere winter stratosphere and its dynamics using five seasonal prediction systems from the Copernicus Climate Change Service (C3S) multi-model database, focusing on the polar vortex and lower-stratosphere wave activity.",
